AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000739> "This property was not in use anywhere in the ontology. Further, it had no definition and therefore its intended usage was unclear. Until a time when this property is required and an official definition created, this property is obsolete so as not to introduce inconsistent usage.")
