# Object Property: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> (obsolete_is developed by)

AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> "Marked as obsolete by Allyson Lister.")
AnnotationAssertion(ns1:obsoleted_in_version <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> "0.3")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> "is developed by and is_developed_by. The former is from the core file and originally had no identifier (though it is now identified via SWO_0004003), and the latter is from the original file (SWO_0000394).  SWO_0000394 was retained and SWO_0004003 marked as obsolete as SWO_0004003 had no usages while SWO_0000394 has many usages. Finally, the underscores were removed from the label of  SWO_0000394 so it would conform to our naming scheme. Please use SWO_0000394 instead.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> "obsolete_is developed by")
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_0004003> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Object Property: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> (obsolete_is specified output of)

AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> "Marked as obsolete by Allyson Lister.")
AnnotationAssertion(ns1:obsoleted_in_version <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> "0.3")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> "There is an object property duplication for is specified output of, where one is from OBI (OBI_0000312) and one is from SWO (SWO_9000058); additionally, the reasoner infers these two object properties as equivalent. Both are the inverse properties for has specified output. It makes sense to retain the OBI object property. The SWO class URI was renamed to the OBI term URI (to make the moving of the axioms across to the OBI term simple), and then an SWO class with the original URI was marked as obsolete. Please use OBI_0000312 instead.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> "obsolete_is specified output of")
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/SWO_9000058> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Object Property: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/organization/SWO_9000059> (obsolete_has_participant)

AnnotationAssertion(ns1:obsoleted_in_version <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/organization/SWO_9000059> "1.4")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/organization/SWO_9000059> "Exact equivalence with RO class http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000057, to the extent that the inverse of RO_0000057 was already present in this ontology as the inverse of this SWO class.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/organization/SWO_9000059> "obsolete_has_participant")
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/swo/organization/SWO_9000059> "true"^^xsd:boolean)


