AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000585> "The original label for this class, .java file, was used in two separate class URIs. The first was SWO_0000585, initially created within the originalsoftwareontology.owl. The second URI is stored within swo_data.owl and is SWO_3000034. As SWO_3000034 is properly modelled as a child of 'Programming language format' this class was retained and SWO_0000585 deemed obsolete. The usages of SWO_0000585 were refactored to reference 3. SWO_3000034, and SWO_0000585 was marked as obsolete. Please use SWO_3000034 instead.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000585> "obsolete_.java file")
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/swo/SWO_0000585> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

